 `.keras` models and their JSON metadata. Interactive API documentation is at
 `/docs`.
 
+### Grade basis (`TOMATO_GRADE_USES_DEFECT`)
+
+By default the grade comes from the ripeness head only (`"grade_basis": "ripeness"`). The defect head
+was trained on the Kaggle `Healthy`/`Reject` set, whose `Reject` label does not match `docs/RUBRIK.md`;
+on the 108 Primer photos it flagged about half of the normal tomatoes as `reject`, which made almost
+every tomato grade C. While the head is not counted, `POST /predict` reports
+`"defect": {"class": "tidak_dinilai", "confidence": 0.0}` and keeps the raw CNN output under
+`defect_raw` for debugging. `ml.predict_image` and the evaluation tools still see the raw defect output.
+
+Set `TOMATO_GRADE_USES_DEFECT=1` before starting the API to count the defect head again
+(`"grade_basis": "ripeness+defect"`, worst level wins as in the rubric):
+
+```powershell
+$env:TOMATO_GRADE_USES_DEFECT = "1"; python -m uvicorn ml.api:app --port 9000
+```
+
 The ResNeXt backbone contains Lambda layers from the trusted
 `image-classifiers` implementation. Checkpoints generated by this training
 workflow are loaded with Keras `safe_mode=False`; only load model artifacts
diff --git a/ml/api.py b/ml/api.py
index 21bfe90..0c740ab 100644
--- a/ml/api.py
+++ b/ml/api.py
@@ -37,6 +37,35 @@ ARCHITECTURE_PATTERN = "^(" + "|".join(sorted(ARCHITECTURES)) + ")$"
 pillow_heif.register_heif_opener()
 logger = logging.getLogger("uvicorn.error")
 
+GRADE_USES_DEFECT_ENV = "TOMATO_GRADE_USES_DEFECT"
+# Ditampilkan ke controller/dashboard bila kepala cacat tidak ikut menentukan grade.
+NOT_ASSESSED_DEFECT: dict[str, Any] = {
+    "class": "tidak_dinilai",
+    "level": None,
+    "confidence": 0.0,
+    "probabilities": {},
+}
+
+
+def _grade_uses_defect() -> bool:
+    """Bawaan: grade hanya dari kematangan. Atur TOMATO_GRADE_USES_DEFECT=1 agar kepala cacat ikut dipakai.
+
+    Alasan: pada 108 foto primer, kepala cacat (dilatih dari dataset Kaggle yang definisi "Reject"-nya
+    berbeda dari rubrik) menandai ~50% tomat normal sebagai reject, sehingga hampir semua jadi grade C.
+    """
+    return os.environ.get(GRADE_USES_DEFECT_ENV, "0") == "1"
+
+
+def _public_result(result: dict[str, Any]) -> dict[str, Any]:
+    """Bentuk respons untuk controller/dashboard. predict_image() tetap mengembalikan keluaran CNN apa adanya
+    (dipakai alat evaluasi); di sini tebakan cacat yang tidak ikut grade tidak ditampilkan sebagai hasil."""
+    if result.get("grade_basis") != "ripeness":
+        return result
+    shown = dict(result)
+    shown["defect_raw"] = result.get("defect")
+    shown["defect"] = dict(NOT_ASSESSED_DEFECT)
+    return shown
+
 
